Package: tuxguard
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: TuxGuard Maintainers <maintainers@tuxguard.local>
Depends: python3.12, python3-tk, i3lock, v4l-utils, lsof, libegl1, libgl1, libglib2.0-0, libgomp1, libsm6, libx11-6, libxext6, libxi6, libxrender1, libxtst6
Recommends: xdg-utils
Description: Local desktop security application with face recognition
 TuxGuard provides local face recognition, PIN/password gates and
 continuous desktop monitoring. Python runtime dependencies are bundled
 in this package, so installation does not invoke pip or require network
 access beyond resolving the declared system dependencies.
 .